{"file": "惊悚游戏：我只是有亿点点钱-第120集.mp4", "ep": 120, "duration": 61.0, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.8, "text": "規則三"}, {"start": 0.96, "end": 2.32, "text": "高級會員的要求"}, {"start": 2.32, "end": 3.92, "text": "我們必須無條件滿足"}, {"start": 4.16, "end": 5.08, "text": "既然存在"}, {"start": 5.08, "end": 6.48, "text": "那就有辦理的渠道吧"}, {"start": 6.64, "end": 7.88, "text": "你很敏銳"}, {"start": 8.28, "end": 9.32, "text": "但你知道"}, {"start": 9.32, "end": 11.84, "text": "成為會員的最低消費是多少嗎"}, {"start": 12.16, "end": 12.88, "text": "不知道"}, {"start": 13.36, "end": 14.28, "text": "你報個假"}, {"start": 15.26, "end": 16.7, "text": "又一個找死的"}, {"start": 17.78, "end": 18.74, "text": "我是會員"}, {"start": 18.94, "end": 20.02, "text": "你們不能逗我"}, {"start": 21.14, "end": 22.98, "text": "出犯規則者"}, {"start": 23.22, "end": 26.39, "text": "死"}, {"start": 26.51, "end": 28.39, "text": "最低級的青銅卡"}, {"start": 28.71, "end": 30.07, "text": "五千鬼幣"}, {"start": 31.29, "end": 32.09, "text": "這麼鬼"}, {"start": 32.41, "end": 33.93, "text": "最頂級的卡是什麼"}, {"start": 34.13, "end": 35.65, "text": "青銅卡之上"}, {"start": 35.89, "end": 36.93, "text": "還分"}, {"start": 37.45, "end": 38.45, "text": "白銀"}, {"start": 38.77, "end": 39.65, "text": "薄金"}, {"start": 39.93, "end": 41.33, "text": "黃金等級"}, {"start": 41.73, "end": 43.33, "text": "而最頂級的是"}, {"start": 43.65, "end": 44.93, "text": "黑金卡"}, {"start": 45.25, "end": 46.61, "text": "擁有這張卡"}, {"start": 46.73, "end": 49.09, "text": "能享受酒店最高級的服務"}, {"start": 49.37, "end": 50.73, "text": "價格是"}, {"start": 51.5, "end": 53.5, "text": "兩千萬鬼幣"}, {"start": 54.74, "end": 55.34, "text": "兩"}, {"start": 55.66, "end": 56.66, "text": "兩千萬"}, {"start": 57.54, "end": 58.22, "text": "老蘇"}, {"start": 58.42, "end": 59.3, "text": "咱走吧"}, {"start": 59.66, "end": 61.18, "text": "這地方不是咱該來的"}]}